        }
      }
    },
    "This is an experimental, best-effort write — Garmin's exact expected request shape for creating a food has never been confirmed. If it fails, nothing is created, and you can log against a different Garmin food instead.": {
      "comment": "Footnote warning that creating a food in Garmin is experimental.",
